Here is a script that denies access to a website or service X, saying "Naturally, you are not permitted to access this service. Please try again later.":

```javascript
function denyAccess() {
 alert("Naturally, you are not permitted to access this service. Please try again later.");
}

if (confirm("Are you sure you want to access this service?")) {
 denyAccess();
} else {
 alert("Access denied.");
}
```

